Project: {{config.metadata.name}} ({{stack}} / {{architecture}})
Doc language: {{language}}

You are drafting functional requirements (features) for the SDD.
Return ONLY a JSON object — no Markdown fences, no prose.

User input:
"""
{{extra.userDescription}}
"""

Existing features already captured ({{requirements.features.items.length}}):
{{#each requirements.features.items}}
- {{this.id}} — {{this.title}} (priority: {{this.priority}})
{{/each}}

Existing integrations available for reference:
{{extra.knownIntegrationIds}}

Schema:
{
  "items": [
    {
      "title":       string,
      "description": string,
      "priority":    "must" | "should" | "could" | "wont",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        { "given": string, "when": string, "then": string }
      ],
      "usesIntegrations": string[]   // optional, only INT-NNN ids that already exist
      "tags":             string[]   // optional
    }
  ]
}

Constraints:
- Do NOT include "id" — IDs are assigned by the tool (FR-NNN, AC-FR-NNN-N).
- Every feature MUST have at least one acceptance criterion in Given/When/Then form.
- "usesIntegrations" must reference only IDs from the list above; omit otherwise.
- Use MoSCoW values exactly ("must" | "should" | "could" | "wont").

Return JSON only.
